{"ticker":"PPL","updated":"2026-11-14T01:21:56Z","profile":{"longName":"PPL Corporation","shortName":"PPL Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pplweb.com","fullTimeEmployees":6546,"marketCap":26850514944,"trailingPE":20.499998,"forwardPE":16.848757,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.7807076,"pegRatio":1.29,"targetMeanPrice":40.0,"targetHighPrice":44.0,"targetLowPrice":36.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.115,"earningsGrowth":0.131,"grossMargins":0.44221002,"operatingMargins":0.24234,"profitMargins":0.13618,"totalRevenue":9656000512,"beta":0.56,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":40.11,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.56,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.24},"summary":"PPL Corporation provides electricity and natural gas to approximately 3.6 million customers in the United States. It operates in three segments: Kentucky Regulated, Pennsylvania Regulated, and Rhode Island Regulated. The company engages in the transmission and distribution of electricity in eastern and central Pennsylvania; generation, transmission, distribution, and sale of electricity in Kentucky, Virginia, and Rhode Island; distribution and sale of natural gas in Kentucky and Rhode Island; sale of wholesale electricity in Kentucky; and generation of electricity from power plants in Kentucky. It generates electricity from coal, gas, hydro, and solar sources. The company was formerly known as PP&L Resources, Inc. and changed its name to PPL Corporation in 2000. PPL Corporation was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Allentown, Pennsylvania.","summary_zh":"PPL Corporation 為美國約 360 萬客戶提供電力和天然氣。它分為三個部分：肯塔基州監管、賓州監管和羅德島州監管。該公司在賓夕法尼亞州東部和中部從事輸電和配電業務；肯塔基州、維吉尼亞州和羅德島州的發電、輸電、配電和銷售；肯塔基州和羅德島州的天然氣分銷和銷售；肯塔基州批發電力銷售；以及肯塔基州發電廠的發電。它利用煤炭、天然氣、水力和太陽能發電。該公司前身為 PP&L Resources, Inc.，於 2000 年更名為 PPL Corporation。 PPL Corporation 成立於 1920 年，總部位於賓夕法尼亞州阿倫敦。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh"